sequenceDiagram
    participant Platform as rhods-operator<br/>(platform SA)
    participant API as kube-apiserver<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant Op as ai-gateway-operator<br/>redhat-ods-applications
    participant FS as /opt/manifests<br/>(emptyDir)
    participant MaaS as maas-controller
    participant Prom as Prometheus<br/>(OpenShift monitoring)

    rect rgb(230, 240, 255)
    Note over Platform,Op: Flow 1 - Platform enables a sub-component
    Platform->>API: Deploy operator overlay, set spec.*.managementState=Managed<br/>HTTPS 6443, platform SA token
    API-->>Op: Watch event on AIGateway default-aigateway<br/>HTTPS 6443, operator SA token
    Op->>FS: Rewrite params.env (RELATED_IMAGE_*, namespaces), kustomize render
    Op->>API: SSA apply CRDs, RBAC, Deployments, Webhook, Kuadrant/Istio objects<br/>Ensure infra + grid namespaces
    Op->>API: Read sub-component Deployments, MaaS Config/default, grid CRD Established
    Op->>API: Patch AIGateway status (conditions, module, releases[platform])
    end

    rect rgb(230, 255, 230)
    Note over Prom,Op: Flow 2 - Metrics scrape
    Prom->>Op: GET /metrics via ai-gateway-metrics-service<br/>HTTPS 8443, cluster TLS profile, Bearer token
    Op->>API: TokenReview + SubjectAccessReview<br/>HTTPS 6443, operator SA token
    API-->>Op: Allowed (non-resource /metrics get)
    Op-->>Prom: Prometheus metrics
    end

    rect rgb(255, 240, 230)
    Note over Op,MaaS: Flow 3 - MaaS removal handshake (modelsAsAService: Removed)
    Op->>API: Annotate maas-controller Deployment teardown-requested=true<br/>Keep MaaS manifests rendered
    API-->>MaaS: Watch event
    MaaS->>API: Self-teardown, set teardown-completed=true<br/>maas-controller SA
    API-->>Op: Deployment annotation observed
    Op->>API: GC MaaS + ai-gateway-controller resources<br/>Delete maas-controller-secret-migrate Role/RoleBinding
    Note over Op,API: Infra namespace and maas-db-config are preserved
    end
